<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>本草经 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 20:16:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>药性总义</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-2-yaoxingzongyi/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 20:16:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-2-yaoxingzongyi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/">本草经</category><description>《神农本草经》是我国最早的药物学经典，成书年代虽存争议，但其作为中医药理论基石的地位无可替代，现存版本为后世学者辑佚整理而成，收录365种药物并系统论述其药性、用法及临床原则，虽含汉代神学色彩内容，但核心药效理论至今仍具指导意义。</description></item><item><title>本草经前言</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-1-qianyan/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 20:15:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-1-qianyan/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/">本草经</category><description>《神农本草经》是我国最早的药物学经典，成书年代虽存争议，但其作为中医药理论基石的地位无可替代，现存版本为后世学者辑佚整理而成，收录365种药物并系统论述其药性、用法及临床原则，虽含汉代神学色彩内容，但核心药效理论至今仍具指导意义。</description></item><item><title>为什么学神农本草经</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-0-bencaojing/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/0-0-bencaojing/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F/">本草经</category><description>《神农本草经》是中医经方的重要基础，强调药性理解对灵活用药的关键作用，批判《本草纲目》杂乱不实用，并探讨了中药的多样性、剂型选择、剂量换算及古今差异，主张辨证施治而非拘泥于君臣佐使。</description></item></channel></rss>